  "description": "RagDoc Phase 3.A — 5 SLO panels (chat first_token / total / retrieve recall / rerank / llm call_total) + Phase 3 / P3-5 cost observability (token rate + daily cost approximation).",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
